Package: Metafora
Type: Package
Title: A Unified Synthesis Tool
Version: 2.0.1
Date: 2026-11-18
Authors@R: c(
    person("Maurizio", "Agosti", email = "magosti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jonathon", "Love", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: This versatile module provides a streamlined interface for conducting
             meta-analyses using the robust metafor R package engine by Wolfgang Viechtbauer.
             It offers a unified framework to handle six core data types:
             correlations, dichotomous outcomes, pre-calculated effect sizes, mean differences,
             proportions, and Cronbach’s alpha.
             Whether you are aggregating raw experimental data or standardized coefficients,
             Metafora ensures statistical rigor across all research designs.
